,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107102","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107102","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107102.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107102.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-04T15:41:57Z"},"body":"Currently, the Debugger dock is slightly raised compared to the rest of the docks on the bottom panel. It compensates for this on the left and right with custom negative margins, but neglects to do this on the bottom. \r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the margin by adding a negative margin to the bottom, bringing the Debugger dock in line with the other docks.\r\n\r\nThis clip shows the after of the PR, note how the Debugger dock does not move up relative to the buttons when clicked on.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/398f7dd7-d8df-4fb5-92c9-c67087e0daab\r\n\r\nThis change also saves some vertical screen space, if not by much.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng